SUMMARY:Ghibli Museum tickets go on sale (for December 2026)
DESCRIPTION:Official rule: “Tickets become available for purchase at 10 a
 .m. (JST) on the 10th of each month for the subsequent month. For example\
 , tickets for February 1st through February 28th go on sale at 10a.m.(JST)
  on January 10th.”\nSource: https://www.ghibli-museum.jp/en/tickets/ (ch
 ecked on 4 November 2026)\nDate calculated by Before You Fly from the offi
